{"seq":2,"slug":"relational-algebra-plans","title":"关系代数与逻辑计划","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/query-optimization-execution/foundations/relational-algebra-plans","wordCount":1282,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"关系代数与逻辑计划\">关系代数与逻辑计划</h1><p>优化器不会盯着 SQL 字符串发愁。它先把查询翻译成一种更适合机器推理的代数形式——关系代数表达式，也就是逻辑计划树。这个翻译之所以重要，是因为关系代数带着一整套「换种写法但结果不变」的等价定律。有了这些定律，优化器才敢理直气壮地把过滤条件挪到别处、把连接换个顺序，而保证你拿到的答案分毫不差。可以说，关系代数是整个查询优化得以成立的数学合同。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>关系代数把「表」当作集合（或多重集），把查询当作一连串作用在集合上的运算。每个运算输入一个或两个关系、输出一个新关系，因此运算可以层层嵌套，自然形成一棵树。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    Q[SQL: SELECT u.name FROM users u&lt;br/&gt;JOIN orders o ON u.id=o.uid&lt;br/&gt;WHERE u.age&gt;30] --&gt; P[投影 π_name]&#10;    P --&gt; S[选择 σ_age&gt;30]&#10;    S --&gt; J[连接 ⋈ u.id=o.uid]&#10;    J --&gt; T1[users]&#10;    J --&gt; T2[orders]\">flowchart TD\n    Q[SQL: SELECT u.name FROM users u&lt;br/&gt;JOIN orders o ON u.id=o.uid&lt;br/&gt;WHERE u.age&gt;30] --&gt; P[投影 π_name]\n    P --&gt; S[选择 σ_age&gt;30]\n    S --&gt; J[连接 ⋈ u.id=o.uid]\n    J --&gt; T1[users]\n    J --&gt; T2[orders]</pre><p>这棵树自底向上读，就是一份逻辑计划：先连接两张表，再过滤年龄，最后投影出姓名。下表列出最核心的几个算子及其 SQL 对应。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>算子</th>\n<th>符号</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>SQL 对应</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>选择</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>σ</mi><mtext>cond</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sigma_{\\text{cond}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">cond</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>按条件筛选行</td>\n<td><code>WHERE</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>投影</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>π</mi><mtext>cols</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\pi_{\\text{cols}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">cols</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>选取列、去重</td>\n<td><code>SELECT 列</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>连接</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mo>⋈</mo><mi>θ</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\bowtie_{\\theta}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.655em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\"><span class=\"mrel\">⋈</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>按条件拼接两表</td>\n<td><code>JOIN ON</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>并</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>∪</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\cup</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∪</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>合并两关系</td>\n<td><code>UNION</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>差</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">-</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>集合相减</td>\n<td><code>EXCEPT</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>分组聚合</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>γ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\gamma</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">γ</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>分组求聚合</td>\n<td><code>GROUP BY</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"基本算子与它们的语义\">基本算子与它们的语义</h2><p>选择 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>σ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sigma</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span></span></span></span></span> 保留满足谓词的行，行数只减不增，列结构不变。投影 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>π</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\pi</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span></span></span></span></span> 保留指定列，在纯关系代数（集合语义）下还会去重——这与 SQL 默认的多重集语义不同，SQL 的 <code>SELECT</code> 不去重，要 <code>SELECT DISTINCT</code> 才去重。这个差异看似学术，却实实在在影响优化：去重是个昂贵操作，优化器若误以为某处会去重就可能算错代价。</p>\n<p>连接 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mo>⋈</mo><mi>θ</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\bowtie_\\theta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.655em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\"><span class=\"mrel\">⋈</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是优化的主战场。它在概念上等价于「先求两表的笛卡尔积 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>×</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\times</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">×</span></span></span></span></span>，再用 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>σ</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sigma_\\theta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 过滤」：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><msub><mo>⋈</mo><mi>θ</mi></msub><mi>S</mi><mo>≡</mo><msub><mi>σ</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>R</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>S</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R \\bowtie_\\theta S \\equiv \\sigma_\\theta(R \\times S)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\"><span class=\"mrel\">⋈</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≡</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>笛卡尔积会产生 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>R</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>×</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>S</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">|R| \\times |S|</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span></span></span></span></span> 行，对两张百万行的表就是万亿行——绝不可能真的物化。所以连接算子的全部意义，就在于用聪明的物理算法（哈希、排序合并）直接算出过滤后的结果，跳过中间那个天文数字。具体算法见 <a href=\"../access-methods/join-algorithms\">连接算法</a>。</p>\n<p>分组聚合 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>γ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\gamma</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">γ</span></span></span></span></span> 把行按某些列分桶，对每桶算 <code>count</code>、<code>sum</code> 等聚合值。它和投影里的去重一样，通常需要排序或哈希来实现，是计划里的「重」节点。</p>\n<h2 id=\"等价规则-优化的法律依据\">等价规则：优化的法律依据</h2><p>关系代数的价值在于一批可证明的等价变换。优化器每做一次改写，背后都对应其中一条规则。最重要的几条：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>选择下推</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>σ</mi><mi>c</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>R</mi><mo>⋈</mo><mi>S</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>≡</mo><msub><mi>σ</mi><mi>c</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>R</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋈</mo><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sigma_c(R \\bowtie S) \\equiv \\sigma_c(R) \\bowtie S</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">⋈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≡</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">⋈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span>（当条件 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span> 只涉及 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span></span> 的列）。把过滤尽早做，连接的输入就更小。</li>\n<li><strong>连接交换律</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mo>⋈</mo><mi>S</mi><mo>≡</mo><mi>S</mi><mo>⋈</mo><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R \\bowtie S \\equiv S \\bowtie R</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6883em;vertical-align:-0.005em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">⋈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≡</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6883em;vertical-align:-0.005em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">⋈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span></span>。让优化器可以自由调换连接的左右两边。</li>\n<li><strong>连接结合律</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>R</mi><mo>⋈</mo><mi>S</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋈</mo><mi>T</mi><mo>≡</mo><mi>R</mi><mo>⋈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>S</mi><mo>⋈</mo><mi>T</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(R \\bowtie S) \\bowtie T \\equiv R \\bowtie (S \\bowtie T)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">⋈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">⋈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≡</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6883em;vertical-align:-0.005em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">⋈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">⋈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>。这是连接顺序搜索的根基——三张表的连接有多种结合方式，代价可能差几个数量级。</li>\n<li><strong>投影下推</strong>：尽早丢掉不需要的列，减少每行的宽度。</li>\n<li><strong>选择与投影交换</strong>：在不丢掉过滤所需列的前提下调换两者顺序。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>这些规则分两类用途。选择下推、投影下推这种「无论数据长什么样都更好」的，归 <a href=\"../optimization/rule-based-rewrite\">基于规则的查询重写</a> 处理；而连接交换律、结合律这种「好坏取决于表大小」的，要交给 <a href=\"../optimization/cost-based-optimizer\">基于代价的优化器</a> 配合代价模型来搜索。</p>\n<h2 id=\"逻辑计划与物理计划的分界\">逻辑计划与物理计划的分界</h2><p>逻辑计划只说「做什么」：要做一次连接、一次过滤。它不说「怎么做」：连接用哈希还是排序合并、扫描走索引还是全表。把逻辑算子映射到具体的物理算子，是优化的最后一步。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    L[逻辑: ⋈ u.id=o.uid] --&gt; P1[物理选项 1&lt;br/&gt;哈希连接 HashJoin]&#10;    L --&gt; P2[物理选项 2&lt;br/&gt;排序合并 MergeJoin]&#10;    L --&gt; P3[物理选项 3&lt;br/&gt;嵌套循环 NestedLoop]\">flowchart TD\n    L[逻辑: ⋈ u.id=o.uid] --&gt; P1[物理选项 1&lt;br/&gt;哈希连接 HashJoin]\n    L --&gt; P2[物理选项 2&lt;br/&gt;排序合并 MergeJoin]\n    L --&gt; P3[物理选项 3&lt;br/&gt;嵌套循环 NestedLoop]</pre><p>同一个逻辑连接对应多个物理连接算子，每个的代价随输入大小、是否有序、是否有索引而不同。优化器的工作，本质就是为逻辑计划树上的每个节点挑一个最便宜的物理实现，并为整棵树挑一个最便宜的整体形态。这一步如何打分，见 <a href=\"cost-model\">代价模型与基数估计</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>关系代数把查询表示成算子树（逻辑计划），是优化器内部的中间语言。</li>\n<li>核心算子是选择、投影、连接、分组聚合；连接等价于笛卡尔积加过滤，但绝不真的物化笛卡尔积。</li>\n<li>一批可证明的等价规则（选择下推、连接交换/结合律、投影下推）是所有优化改写的法律依据。</li>\n<li>等价规则按收益是否依赖数据分布，分别归规则重写和代价搜索处理。</li>\n<li>逻辑计划说「做什么」，物理计划说「怎么做」，优化的终点是把逻辑算子映射成最便宜的物理算子。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"关系代数与逻辑计划","id":"关系代数与逻辑计划"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"基本算子与它们的语义","id":"基本算子与它们的语义"},{"level":2,"text":"等价规则：优化的法律依据","id":"等价规则-优化的法律依据"},{"level":2,"text":"逻辑计划与物理计划的分界","id":"逻辑计划与物理计划的分界"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"查询生命周期与处理流程","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/query-optimization-execution/foundations/query-lifecycle"},"next":{"title":"代价模型与基数估计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/query-optimization-execution/foundations/cost-model"}}